bel:"Work on every screen",platformsTitle:"Web, desktop and mobile.",platformsText:"Use the web app online for a shared workspace. The desktop app can work locally or connect to the cloud; mobile pairing and shared sessions use cloud mode.",platformWeb:"Web app",platformWebText:"Run your workspace in the browser and use cloud mode to keep web, desktop and mobile sessions in sync.",platformDesktop:"Desktop app",platformDesktopText:"Work locally on this computer when offline, or connect to your cloud workspace and shared devices.",platformMobile:"Mobile app",platformMobileText:"Keep the camera ready, scan items in sequence, send them to this phone or a connected till, and complete simple sales.",valueLabel:"Made for the real flow of work",valueTitle:"A phone that helps sell, not just scan.",valueText:"Use the mobile app as a fast companion scanner or as a lightweight second point of sale.",mobileValueTitle:"Scan, review, sell.",mobileValueText:"The camera stays open between scans. Add products to the phone’s cart or route them to a chosen live web or desktop till. Review the current basket, adjust quantities and discounts, select a payment method, and record the sale without re-entering the items.",mobileValueRecent:"See recent transactions, today’s activity and the connected till status on the phone.",rolesValueTitle:"Each person sees what they need.",rolesValueText:"The shop owner controls account roles and permissions. Mobile tabs and financial details follow those permissions, so a cashier can focus on selling without being shown owner-only information.",plannedBadge:"Planned — not available yet",internationalLabel:"One platform, a world of products",internationalTitle:"Explore products across international markets.",internationalText:"A planned product directory will help businesses discover and add products from markets around the world, with category variety designed for local catalogues.",marketCountLabel:"country markets*",productCountLabel:"products per market*",internationalDisclaimer:"*Planning placeholders, not current catalogue coverage. Online product search and import are not available yet.",downloadsLabel:"Get the apps",downloadsTitle:"Choose where your team works.",downloadsText:"The desktop and mobile download links will be enabled when release builds and store listings are published.",downloadDesktop:"Download desktop app",downloadMobile:"Download mobile app",downloadComingSoon:"Coming soon",downloadUnavailable:"Download not published yet",downloadOpen:"Get the app",downloadAvailable:"Release link configured",featuresLabel:"Everything you need, in one place",featuresTitle1:"A living inventory,",featuresTitle2:"not a frozen spreadsheet.",featuresText:"Every movement updates your indicators. You keep full visibility, even when activity speeds up.",feature1Title:"Stock always accurate",feature1Text:"Track incoming items, outgoing items and critical levels from a single inventory, updated with every movement.",feature2Title:"Frictionless scanning",feature2Text:"Scan a code, confirm an operation and keep working. Fewer entries, fewer mistakes.",feature3Title:"Smarter decisions",feature3Text:"Spot your best sellers, your dead ends and your reorder levels thanks to clear indicators.",feature4Title:"Aligned teams",feature4Text:"Share the right numbers between sales, suppliers and management, with data kept in the same place.",learnMore:"Learn more",methodLabel:"A quick start",methodTitle:"From your data to your decisions, without a break.",methodText:"Start with what you already have. Hexagone then organises the daily work of your teams.",methodLink:"Explore the journey",step1Title:"Import your catalogue",step1Text:"Reuse your product file or start with a few references. Hexagone structures your items, variants and thresholds.",step2Title:"Centralise movements",step2Text:"Sales, purchases, returns and inventories feed the same stock. Every operation keeps a clear trace.",step3Title:"Steer with peace of mind",step3Tex